cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use paperunit to publish an audit, please cite the specific audit report (its report_sha256) and, for the tool, this repository."
title: "paperunit: executable paper audits"
abstract: "Bind each paper claim to a check that a third party can re-run; audit reports carry evidence-local verdicts and no aggregate scores."
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.4.0
